.TH GENERATE\-HTML\-NATIVE 1 "July 2026" "reta_arch_mojo" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
generate\-html\-native \- native helper that renders Reta HTML output assets
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B generate\-html\-native
.RI [ ARGUMENT ...]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B generate\-html\-native
is the compiled native backend used by generate_html to produce HTML output and related generated assets.

.SH NOTES
This command is installed because it is a build or diagnostic target of the native Mojo port. Normal users usually start with .BR reta (1), .BR rp (1), .BR rpl (1), .BR rpe (1), or .BR rpb (1).
.SH EXIT STATUS
Returns 0 on success and non-zero on errors, failed checks, missing build targets, or invalid arguments.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR reta(1), rp(1), rpl(1), rpe(1), rpb(1), generate_html(1)
